{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_06_beg","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_06","title":"猎人之夜","storyCode":"CV-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"af50bd44cda5c89c3041cc93aa660a68e804a1d3f56ac279ea9a99186915ae1b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g7_sonwydowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们真的这么早就要来吗？现在银行外面一个人也没有啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有薄荷糖可以提神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，但我想薄荷糖应该起不了什么用，来，优等生，你来掐我一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开工吧。朋友们，都清醒点！哎，说的就是你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......欠——抱、抱歉，芙兰卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，接下来认真听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这间银行总共有四个出口，贝尼，你带四个人守在后门，小查，右边就交给你和安妮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铜板，你和硬币去车库门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人，与我们三个一起留在正门......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面色不快的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，打扰了，女士，麻烦问下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面色不快的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们今天一天都会在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是的，先生......不过我们只是站岗值勤，不会影响大家办理业务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面色不快的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"办理业务？前几天我在这里签了一份拓荒协议，那是我最后一份业务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面色不快的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......算是给他们的服务质量打个评价吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面色不快的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（倒立大拇指）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面色不快的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这颗子弹......是你托杰西卡带来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，几年前我在维多利亚的一个古董店见到了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪你当时把营地翻了个遍也没找到，现在想应该是某个军官把那把铳偷偷带去了维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今铳已经没了下落，这颗子弹是他仅存的遗物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早告诉那家伙不要在铳上搞那么花里胡哨的纹样了......这颗子弹你为什么不自己留着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起我，你才应该是那个保存它的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是觉得愧疚吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟朋友一场，最后如此收场，我也很难过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的愧疚与难过有用吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什么，伍迪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唤回你的手下，停止驱赶居民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，就算黑钢离开，政府还会派其他的佣兵公司来，结局还是一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本可以拒绝这项任务的，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑钢国际虽说是“国际”，可总部毕竟是在哥伦比亚，政府委派的任务，我们没有什么拒绝的权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你也有要夹着尾巴做人的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今时不同往日了，在哥伦比亚政府眼里，我们这些武夫比不过那些特里蒙的精尖人才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，大老板，在这份与银行还有政府的合同里，黑钢能得到什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不是份长久的合同，伍迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"政府提出要求，我们照做，事后拿报酬，除此外......我并不关心，也不容我关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得还在拉特兰时，你总会和我讲很多，大到国家间的摩擦，小到人群中的矛盾......那些因此而受苦的人们永远是你的话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那都是很久远的事了，伍迪，我记不清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我记得很清楚，就在那段从图书馆到学生宿舍的路上，你告诉我，强大的人保护自己，伟大的人捍卫他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么到现在，亲眼看到了那些人，你却只会不咸不淡地讲，不容关心，那便不关心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，我们都老了，能关心的东西非常有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我们都老了，还能关心的东西剩得不多......剩下的，都是最重要的东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这一把残破的老骨头，保住地块上所有人是不可能了，但身边的人......我会死死守着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我发誓，如果他们因为你的到来而受到伤害，那我会把这颗子弹原封不动地还给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我衷心希望，事情不会发展到那一步，伍迪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g6_sonwydowntown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，人越聚越多了......要拉封锁线吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不到那一步。我们并不清楚人群的意图，贸然行事只会更难控制情势。如果可以沟通，我希望能先与组织者进行交涉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......从凌晨到现在，大家都是陆陆续续地出现，不像有什么组织的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没人带着武器，看起来不像是要诉诸暴力，可我还是很担心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我们的压力自始至终都不在面前......而在身后。"},{"type":"narration","text":"回过头，三人看向银行明亮整洁的玻璃门窗。\n玻璃的结实将外界灰暗、冰冷与融化的污雪阻挡在外。\n但屋内的温暖与明亮却不会因玻璃的透明，倾泻到比银行门下最后一层阶梯更远的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，你看那个人是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板娘......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g4_bank"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们中的大部分都已经签下了拓荒协议，还聚在这干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怕什么，黑钢手里的东西可不是吃素的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是......唉，我电视都打开了，本来打算看看新年特别访谈的，也不知道今年州长会讲些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，翻来覆去，不还是那些话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"观众朋友们，大家好。首先，我代表节目组提前祝大家新年快乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本次节目我们将采访的是州长先生，就本州居民关心的一系列问题向他提问——州长先生，您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下来是我们节目的例行提醒——本次节目是在九月份录制的，播放时的情况可能已经发生变化，敬请各位留意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"责任全在特里蒙的科学家们。因为他们研究不出让信使一天跑遍哥伦比亚的交通工具，我们只好提前三个月录节目，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g6_sonwydowntown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜女士，今天天气这么冷，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，但我今天哪里也不会去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道银行与诸位之间的矛盾激烈......有诉求的话，或许可以由我向银行转达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用紧张，雷蛇队长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来到这里的人大多都已经签署过拓荒协议了，等车队到来，就离开了。你问我们还有什么诉求，还想讨要什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有了。我们不会再做无用功了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们来是为了什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从小就被教导，在告别那些陪伴我们很久的人或者事物时，要好好再看一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这阵子......我看过了自己的餐厅，看过了矿厂，看过了地块上每一个地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而今天，在新年的第一天，我来看那个让我不得不告别这一切的罪魁祸首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜女士，请容我提醒你，每一份抵押协议都是你自己签署的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，没错，路是我们走的，也是你们指的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无稽之谈，就好比那位先生，我隐约记得，在他生意受挫四处借钱无门时，是我们为他发放了四万的贷款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，刚开始我欠你们四万，这笔钱不大不小，我只想着赶紧还完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你们又说，要合理规划投资和负债，我不该一次性把钱连本带利还清，你们提供分期优惠，我可以用余下的钱买你们的理财产品......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你们是借了我四万，可最后我要付出的，却是我的店铺、房、车，甚至亲人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们当初相信了你们的宣传。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们说，会让我们的生活蒸蒸日上，帮助我们实现更加美好的未来......但你们规划的所谓未来里，我们这些客户的位置又在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我们是傻瓜，我们贪财，我们目光短浅，馋那一点甜头，所以都上了钩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可女士，为什么？为什么整个地块上所有人都像饿疯了的鳞一样，迫不及待要去咬那只要命的钩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是我们自己的问题吗？还是说，这片水塘从一开始就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇小姐，请在十分钟内将这群人疏散干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烦请尽快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）杰西卡！想办法给克里夫先生拨通电话，赶快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我马上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，根本打不通......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再试试......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，队长，我得去当面告诉克里夫先生，这里到底在发生什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......海伦娜女士，杰西卡已经去向高层汇报情况了，一会儿应该......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想过自己的未来吗，雷蛇小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......一直想着要开一家安保公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会为了它贷一笔钱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如有必要，我会，因为那是我一直想做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可要小心了，那钱只是以未来为名罢了，拿到它并不算触碰到了未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是你保护着的那些人教会了我们这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是窃贼，是骗子，他们在路牌上做手脚，却反过来嘲笑我们走上了危险的夜路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......明白，诸位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"州长先生，我们不妨直接讨论一些核心问题。众所周知，在拓荒区和建成区之间，本州还存在着大量过渡区域——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"区域内存在着的聚居点，大多是有几十年历史的拓荒地块，有自己的支柱产业，但还不足以达到移动城市的标准，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正如您所说。我听说，州政府最近在考虑这些地块的处理问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"移动地块是重要的战略资源，但我不能苟同您的“处理”一词，对过渡区及其居民的帮扶早已成为州政府案头最重要的事项之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"额外投资、税收减免、入学优惠、低息贷款......过渡区居民们正从这些政策里受益良多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g4_bank"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"经理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去把那份授权协议拿出来，州政府发来的，紧急事态下授权给我们指挥私人武装的那份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快去，可别在这时候傻愣着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g6_sonwydowntown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"几十年前，我们的父辈来到此地，哥伦比亚的签证官说想听他们的梦想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"后来，地块的发展蓬勃，你们鼓励我们走向美好的未来与明天，说整个哥伦比亚都想听我们充满干劲的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但现在我们身无分文，拖着病体，再无价值后，你们就把大门一关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有这样的道理！我们会呐喊，我们会怒吼，我们会咆哮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而你们最好竖起耳朵，听好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"暴雪欲来，狂风将至♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们两手空空，被推往荒野♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"远离生长的土地♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"找寻一抔属于自己的土壤♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"关于低息贷款......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您在迟疑？这很罕见，我以为您还会不停地用问题轰炸我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不瞒您说，我确实认为这是一个很尖锐的问题，希望您能如实回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一些人认为，减免贷款利息是在用税收补贴当地经济，不仅可能让钱打水漂，还可能挫伤当地居民自力更生的积极性，让他们变得懒惰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作为州政府，我们确实在一些地块发现了类似的情况，但我们也要向其他公民呼吁，请多给过渡区一些时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请相信，当地的居民并非懒惰，而是需要更多的时间，来学习如何重新利用自己的双腿行走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"访谈嘉宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当他们强壮到足以丢掉拐杖的那一天，他们会如数还清款项，并感激我们的慷慨和哥伦比亚公民间的兄弟之情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g4_bank"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在这里，经理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去把窗户都关好，窗帘拉紧，离门窗远一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们这......是在外面唱歌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g6_sonwydowntown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从耕田到抡锤♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一切这些事情都是我们完成的♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们诞生起就♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"注定要永远负重前行♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分钟到了，既然他们执意不肯离开，我们应该采取更强硬的措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，女士，做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们之间的关系本不应该如此难堪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们执意玩忽职守，那我只能遗憾地通知你，这支小队现在交由我来指挥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你算什么东——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回收地块的协议是由政府、银行与黑钢三方共同签署，里面有条目写明，黑钢分派来的人手在特殊情况下须听从我们的指挥调度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是当时发来的授权书，请雷蛇小姐过目。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您无权越级指挥我们的行动，女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，这上面写得一清二楚，我有权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"动手吧，雷蛇小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请恕我拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您现在拒绝的可不是一间小小银行的请求，而是政府的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要忘记帮助黑钢走到现在的是什么，是哥伦比亚倾注在你们身上的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是......信任很容易崩塌，一次小小的失约，就足以重创搭建好的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"动手，我不想再多说了，雷蛇小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"挨饿的是我们，送死的是我们♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了空头支票付出一切的是我们♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但未来......未来却没有我们♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，家乡♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我将远离生长的土地♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地块居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只为找寻一抔属于自己的土壤♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女士，你再说多少次都没有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不会开火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重复一遍，我不会开火，也不会允许我小队的任何一个成员开火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的任务仅是确保无人冲进银行，伤害到你们宝贵的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"据我判断，他们对你们的生命安全没有任何威胁，只想和你们作一场告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们脆弱的心灵因此受伤，那我深表同情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟......离别总是伤感的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家听好，没有我的命令，都不许擅动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收、收到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，女士，这是真实的歌声，多听听没坏处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
